OL,3,AManchester's Co-op Live evacuated after
OL,4,A'unknown substance' let off in crowd   
OL,6,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said a 
OL,7,Fmajor incident was declared after      
OL,8,Freports of people suffering from the   
OL,9,Feffects of an unknown substance, which 
OL,10,Fpolice initially believed to be tear   
OL,11,Fgas.                                   
